            <lg xml:id="m-c38f9aa8-2f57-4a33-9409-d7d1868e19ee">
              <l xml:id="m-7cfd24e0-dad1-4553-a4b6-5238784049ca" facs="#m-6b2d73d3-3b4c-4cc2-99ab-507ad067d6ae" label="ambiguous">April 14.</l><l xml:id="m-21087177-8bca-4baa-b6ae-e91b51dd38c2" facs="#m-4e2266b4-12cf-408d-8548-460d48516832" label="ambiguous">1429</l><l xml:id="m-3033c1b6-04dd-49ba-9fb8-3d9f2c7a281d" facs="#m-c093a445-9a4a-48d1-b267-2e6a95177a3b" label="lyrics-like">mén¬</l><l xml:id="m-194223d8-5cdb-4476-a593-b7b1e07c35c1" facs="#m-34b5c653-2795-406d-82ba-0f72bc8a8f79" label="lyrics-like">és¬</l><l xml:id="m-ffcfa9bc-915b-4f5b-837f-f32399563bf7" facs="#m-48c1b8d8-0320-4c10-b980-ad94d2bf72be" label="ambiguous">propter emi¬</l><l xml:id="m-05d31283-730e-4581-8c00-eb3723c0ba5c" facs="#m-d51311dd-fd09-4d18-bcf7-62fa2f72ca3f" label="ambiguous">tum</l><l xml:id="m-f8c8f5db-f89c-4b55-8a14-e8500c0dc6c6" facs="#m-c36eedf6-521c-4075-91b0-6d8326343551" label="ambiguous">se</l><l xml:id="m-81ebfd00-aff3-4828-a4c7-12dd2b584084" facs="#m-702ff5f3-107c-4ddf-9456-4d51056b0174" label="lyrics-like">Jé-su Chrí¬</l><l xml:id="m-1eb7f25f-5b86-4b9e-9d05-f9abc2c8d0af" facs="#m-d4147011-4b7e-4ecf-b0fd-b9cf46b84a24" label="lyrics-like">nén- tem</l><l xml:id="m-b946270e-6d6b-48ac-9d07-69805df2b7d1" facs="#m-0e0e8804-6bfd-4976-a309-d819c3a9c9e7" label="lyrics-like">sci-én- ti-am</l><l xml:id="m-d125dbc9-6cc9-4b04-85ce-1f3aed833c55" facs="#m-ee0dcd00-646b-4d9c-bf79-6799314385d8" label="lyrics-like">sti Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-07da34d0-9857-45a4-b9a2-4c9d288c0966" facs="#m-1ab4bea9-fceb-404f-9904-43ec496ca1eb" label="lyrics-like">mi-ni “mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-d9c75c81-7c76-4ae3-95fe-49f07d7854ac" facs="#m-21899a24-4585-41f2-bec6-546cd2946ab2" label="ambiguous">i</l><l xml:id="m-f991d39b-0ba8-4355-9338-722e2a5979b0" facs="#m-8998a0a5-587f-4860-be92-1d83caad0ade" label="ambiguous">*Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 12.</l><l xml:id="m-bc47cf80-bae5-4cf6-825a-38c35571a446" facs="#m-c0929b79-03b7-485a-8935-e9404742adc3" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Dixit Jesus di-[rit, habet potestátem míttere in</l><l xml:id="m-c9e858e0-b566-4215-a0c7-a91324f176f4" facs="#m-6cb4669f-7a90-4f2a-b8bf-e5c361accf49" label="lyrics-like">I scipulis suis: Nihil opértum est! gehénnam; ita dico vobis, hunc</l><l xml:id="m-ffa0e008-8d05-4c43-9822-ff392f5c2dcd" facs="#m-72f289ac-f969-401a-8c26-8aeb0ce59e01" label="lyrics-like">timéte. Nonne quinque pásseres vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-39fcf36f-4c0c-418a-a8f0-07da9d1bb5cf" facs="#m-6581fa36-c394-4234-9b07-73ed6c5017d4" label="lyrics-like">quod non revelétur; neque abscón¬</l><l xml:id="m-62907364-e64d-4250-b6c5-8b556831c2f6" facs="#m-2155f0d5-ada2-4a0b-a951-e4887026fe40" label="lyrics-like">neunt dipóndio, et unus ex illis non</l><l xml:id="m-4e760e7e-d5aa-48c1-90c3-c8a22ba85879" facs="#m-f24e1490-d961-43d9-927c-6956d2714382" label="lyrics-like">ditum, quod non sciátur. Quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-48bd7c94-c5a3-4f7e-b9a2-329ef30d2ac7" facs="#m-4405f666-d700-4b8c-a7b9-7ccbf53c45ea" label="lyrics-like">est in oblivióne coram Deo? Sed</l><l xml:id="m-33327e5d-f444-4029-81c2-7406d8eb3d9c" facs="#m-c0aee01f-c748-4703-b6c4-1ceea7c77327" label="lyrics-like">quae in ténebris dixístis, in lúmine</l><l xml:id="m-6389a9d2-11e5-4a66-add9-abf9b692c3b4" facs="#m-b13783ea-b7f1-4a84-8509-806e723934cb" label="lyrics-like">et capslli cápitis vestri omnes nume¬</l><l xml:id="m-1c1587a1-7a9d-4baf-8e0d-56016f6aee0b" facs="#m-eddac770-eeee-45af-9ab1-b0fdc90a7def" label="lyrics-like">dicéntur, et quod in aurem locúti</l><l xml:id="m-5e0bd0ca-d673-4d5f-98eb-bc74274f2c60" facs="#m-8ee04d27-d9ec-49bd-8fee-a9e4eef735a4" label="lyrics-like">ráti sunt. Nolite ergo timére; mul¬</l><l xml:id="m-392d0c4c-478c-464d-abbe-2dca720fbc33" facs="#m-70d22c7f-b7bd-422a-a9a7-77e1dc619b86" label="lyrics-like">estis in cubiculis, praedicábitur in</l><l xml:id="m-c5a05b38-680a-4a85-9e48-503ee0c993af" facs="#m-d0737e60-80b7-4c0e-8a11-72117d999cd0" label="lyrics-like">tis passéribus pluris estis vos. Dico</l><l xml:id="m-5e7676a6-371b-460f-a852-ae36446c67bd" facs="#m-2be72c3f-23ed-4fe9-8a58-38955406b946" label="lyrics-like">tectis. Dico autem vobis amícis</l><l xml:id="m-f7215c88-6b5c-476e-ab4d-cec38e0ec444" facs="#m-31b8a8bd-b504-4b8f-abfe-0918a5e5ee06" label="lyrics-like">autem vobis: Omnis quicúmque</l><l xml:id="m-437e1157-b0f8-429a-95b1-18c3e176221e" facs="#m-adf75e1d-e1fe-4834-a296-7f74eec67554" label="lyrics-like">meis: Ne terreámini ab his qui</l><l xml:id="m-fdf27a39-29fd-47a5-bddf-cce953fa942b" facs="#m-1850b924-25d9-46bb-bcc1-501aa9ff34b2" label="lyrics-like">conféssus fúerit me coram homini¬</l><l xml:id="m-00fd9f26-ab44-422a-a33b-77511b3bb0d1" facs="#m-53357f6b-5963-4317-bd1c-2b02948f5ed6" label="lyrics-like">occídunt corpus, et post haec non</l><l xml:id="m-07ef95bf-035b-4ce8-ad92-93345a521c48" facs="#m-77629ffc-579e-4a70-9635-70d8bee76c39" label="lyrics-like">habent ámplius quid fáciant. Ostén¬</l><l xml:id="m-57779aaf-bddb-437f-9078-10eb268bd260" facs="#m-012e40e2-32f0-4348-b581-63b59681c466" label="lyrics-like">bus, et Filius hóminis confitébitur</l><l xml:id="m-33bafb84-2ea8-426b-b6c5-f4ff81fb1654" facs="#m-0d7ceb3e-4769-422e-8603-34d75052b05d" label="ambiguous">illum coram Angelis Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-b8ce3899-9731-4fd7-b6f6-c59157351c71" facs="#m-f248188e-17c7-4a26-bc8d-59df02f0028f" label="lyrics-like">dam autem vobis quem timeátis:</l><l xml:id="m-296b1e76-57ba-4c2b-a6f8-d2b67c76ecea" facs="#m-d7f38756-382e-45ba-b68a-4f77a423e71c" label="lyrics-like">Timéte eum, qui postquam occíde¬</l><l xml:id="m-beb3d03c-842e-4bac-a531-6b4155030100" facs="#m-959d2ce0-8ca8-47fb-ac6a-24851c307691" label="ambiguous">omert.E</l><l xml:id="m-dac794cb-e1be-4102-a3c0-738dc74eaa9f" facs="#m-95aab8bb-8f02-4b91-ac96-962c9fe2c4b3" label="ambiguous">s.</l><l xml:id="m-8f3f0c9e-9daf-4f1c-a0a2-4d955c8c8817" facs="#m-54a8b7f0-09e7-444b-ab11-d7a7dc9d528f" label="lyrics-like">ON e-nim judi-cá-vi me scí¬</l><l xml:id="m-b20381b4-6240-48b6-8983-867cfb73e3a9" facs="#m-057926a0-0179-4a28-bd27-f17b5f772f9b" label="lyrics-like">re á-liquid</l><l xml:id="m-5436e738-576f-4965-8a33-83084a512c8a" facs="#m-e02b7f10-5649-45f4-83b0-0a8f9b5626f9" label="lyrics-like">ni-si Jé-sum Chrí- stum,</l><l xml:id="m-aa043945-7005-4733-b721-a932060ff888" facs="#m-c2bc537e-25b6-4cd2-9659-9adf06901754" label="ambiguous">et hunc</l><l xml:id="m-389256a9-57c3-4396-aa49-f5ce71f6fcad" facs="#m-2a75cc7d-ec5e-4022-93d4-f1303649d922" label="ambiguous">in-ter vos</l><l xml:id="m-20e0235a-e76e-4fa1-80b1-deb01c0a9db9" facs="#m-adb4ecc4-a94d-485e-8760-991d5be8e76c" label="lyrics-like">lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-e4f18ba5-a698-477a-86d3-d2f74fbc79c1" facs="#m-7cd3e24f-8c1a-4a0c-b6b3-1a860b852ff3" label="ambiguous">ia.</l><l xml:id="m-54b67404-99a4-41d5-a252-3c351667a39e" facs="#m-fed60d9c-c922-4bbb-a43d-e72aaaa18048" label="ambiguous">xum. Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-0701b973-d8c2-4c46-b583-d32f259db2da" facs="#m-ec31e125-0459-4f61-ab60-96b876884b68" label="lyrics-like">cru-ci¬ fí¬</l><l xml:id="m-6e103b35-f7ab-4e8c-a055-005afa28eab8" facs="#m-b69b2180-af1f-4116-821d-fc561e5f4d58" label="ambiguous">N S01.— 52</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
